From: =?UTF-8?q?Bedirhan=20Gen=C3=A7aslan?=
 <b2210356065@cs.hacettepe.edu.tr>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 21:14:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/71] Fix the codex-exec build after TurnStartParams gained
 invisible

The non-interactive exec entry point constructs TurnStartParams directly, so
adding the field broke that crate. Nothing about exec should be hidden from
the user, so it starts turns visibly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 codex-rs/exec/src/lib.rs | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/codex-rs/exec/src/lib.rs b/codex-rs/exec/src/lib.rs
index 9552613cc7..8d11797974 100644
--- a/codex-rs/exec/src/lib.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/exec/src/lib.rs
@@ -975,6 +975,7 @@ async fn run_exec_session(args: ExecRunArgs) -> anyhow::Result<()> {
                         thread_id: primary_thread_id_for_span.clone(),
                         turn_trigger: None,
                         client_user_message_id: None,
+                        invisible: false,
                         input: items.into_iter().map(Into::into).collect(),
                         tool_output: None,
                         responsesapi_client_metadata: None,
